  "ap_not_usable": "SimulEval AP assumes len(delays) and reference_length share units; our delays are per speech chunk (5.5-5.9) against a reference length in chars/words (tens), so AP lands at 0.04-0.25 rather than anywhere meaningful. AL/LAAL/DAL are unaffected.",
  "first_audible_definitions": "Two distinct quantities, both reported and not to be mixed: StartOffset is the first fragment's emission time (the internal reports' 首次发音 / first_emission_ms; it equals delays[0] because the first fragment never queues), while 真实可听起始 is audio_quality.leading_silence_ms -- the first voiced frame of the placed audio, energy-based.  For C at k1 they are 2544/2573 ms and 4720/4720 ms respectively."
